					"nextDialogs": [
						751501504
					],
					"speakerTitle": "秘源龙仆"
				},
				{
					"id": 751501504,
					"content": "嘿嘿，这么快又见面了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751501505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751501505,
					"content": "…抱歉，几位的信息从未收录在我的数据库之中。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751501506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "秘源龙仆"
				},
				{
					"id": 751501506,
					"content": "居然有人类深入此地，这件事已经至少有五百年没有发生过了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751501507
					],
					"speakerTitle": "秘源龙仆"
				},
				{
					"id": 751501507,
					"content": "等等，你不是「阿玛鲁」…唔，也不是，你不是「厄卡特尔」吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751501508
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751501508,
					"content": "…确实有以此为识别称呼的个体，但是我并非它们中的任何一个。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751501509
					],
					"speakerTitle": "秘源龙仆"
				},
				{
					"id": 751501509,
					"content": "或许其中曾造成了一些误解。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751501510
					],
					"speakerTitle": "秘源龙仆"
				},
				{
					"id": 751501510,
					"content": "我是被制造出来，以供修库特尔大人进行信息记录的原型机，因此没有名字。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751501511
					],
					"speakerTitle": "秘源龙仆"
				},
				{
					"id": 751501511,
					"content": "呜…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751501512
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 751501512,
					"content": "不，我并非没有名字，我是……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751501513
					],
					"speakerTitle": "秘源龙仆"
				},
				{
					"id": 751501513,
					"content": "我是唯一一个有资格拥有智能的非领主龙仆个体，在修库特尔大人陨落之后，我仍负责最基础的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751501514
					],
					"speakerTitle": "秘源龙仆"
				},
				{
					"id": 751501514,
					"content": "城市最基础的维护和信息的记录。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751501515
					],
					"speakerTitle": "秘源龙仆"
				},
				{
					"id": 751501515,
					"content": "…不过，因为阴影之大敌的侵入，记录散佚了一部分，所以，现在并没有自己名称的数据。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751501516
					],
					"speakerTitle": "秘源龙仆"
				},
				{
					"id": 751501516,
					"content": "呃，看来确实是我们认错人了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751501517
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751501517,
					"content": "没有关系。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751501518
					],
					"speakerTitle": "秘源龙仆"
				},
				{
					"id": 751501518,
					"content": "唔，这只机器人虽然大，但是看上去呆呆的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751501519
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751501519,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}，看来还真的不是那个躲在机器里说话的家伙…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751501520
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751501520,
					"content": "不过它不是说自己负责记录…唔，记录信息吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751501521
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751501521,
					"content": "不如就问问看它知道什么，或者…呃，怎么去那个圣山之心吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751501522,
						751501523
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751501522,
					"content": "或许「那个人」就是这个意思…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751501524
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751501524,
					"content": "呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 751501523,
